# With Great Power . . .: "Enchanted creature gets +2/+2 for each Aura and Equipment attached to it." The Aura counts itself: Bot1's Ornithopter
# (0/2) is a 2/4 with it alone on turn 1. On turn 3 Bot1 equips Web-Shooters (+1/+1) too: two attachments are +4/+4 and the Equipment's own
# +1/+1, so it is a 5/7 (CR 613.4c). Web-Shooters on the battlefield but not yet attached counts for nothing: still 2/4 before it is equipped.

